---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Starfield from '../../components/effects/Starfield';
import GridFloor from '../../components/effects/GridFloor.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="示例文章" description="一篇用于展示博客排版和视觉效果的示例文章" noindex>
  <section class="relative -mx-6 -mt-12 min-h-screen overflow-hidden px-6 pt-24">
    <Starfield client:load />
    <GridFloor />

    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-[15%] top-[20%] h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-zinc-200/50 blur-[100px] animate-float" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[25%] right-[15%] h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-zinc-200/50 blur-[120px] animate-float" style="animation-delay: -4s" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <article class="prose relative z-10 mx-auto">
      <header class="card not-prose mb-10 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10">
        <div class="mb-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs">
          <span class="rounded-full bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-0.5 font-medium text-zinc-600 dark:bg-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-300">示例</span>
          <span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <time class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400" datetime="2024-01-15">2024年1月15日</time>
          <span class="text-zinc-400 dark:text-zinc-500" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
          <span class="text-zinc-500 dark:text-zinc-400">5 分钟阅读</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-black uppercase tracking-wide text-zinc-900 dark:text-zinc-100 sm:text-4xl">
          博客示例文章
        </h1>
      </header>

      <div class="mb-12">
        <p>这是一篇用于展示博客排版、动效背景和内容样式的示例文章。你可以用它检查标题、段落、列表和装饰层在不同主题下的表现。</p>
        <ul>
          <li>响应式文章排版</li>
          <li>星空背景与网格地面效果</li>
          <li>亮色和暗色主题适配</li>
          <li>适合快速验证视觉风格</li>
        </ul>
        <p>评论功能需要绑定真实文章 ID。这个公开示例页不再使用占位 ID，避免误导评论系统。</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
